    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Wigilia",
     "texto": [
      "**Wigilia** is the supper and night of 24 December in Poland; it does not mean any «vigil».",
      "In many families **opłatek** is shared and good wishes are exchanged. Customs vary by region and family."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Some customs",
     "texto": [
      "It is usual to mention twelve dishes for supper and an extra place at the table.",
      "**Dzielić się opłatkiem** means «to share the Christmas wafer»; **składać życzenia**, «to express good wishes»."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
